    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        High resolution Fluorescence lifetime IMaging Micro-Endoscopy (FLIMME) using a single <span class="search-hit mathjax">multimode</span> fiber
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
