    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Rethinking Wine Tasting for Chinese Consumers: A Service Design Approach Enhanced by <span class="search-hit mathjax">Multimodal</span> Personalization
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shan%2C+X">Xinyang Shan</a>, 
      
